{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id15819865"}, "name":{"label":"tamhill"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-12-11T12:48:22-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"1988888113"}, "title":{"label":"Makes a Difference for Me"}, "content":{"label":"I had been using it for a while, dropped off and then came back to it. It really does help me stay on task. I went ahead and bought a lifetime membership. \n\nI used to wish there was more of a selection but they’ve upgraded the music/background sounds I’ve the years since I started, so now it’s definitely 5 stars.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id425176676"}, "name":{"label":"Pedro Delos Santos"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-12T14:00:10-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"1916556978"}, "title":{"label":"Scientifically perfect!"}, "content":{"label":"These guys know what they’re doing! The quiz to find your perfect focus music alone is worth the cost of admission lol, and it’s free! \n\nI honestly didn’t think the test was accurate so I took it multiple times and even tried a different age but the results were the same: Baroque Piano. At first I didn’t like it, but then I started to really get into it. It really WAS my perfect focus music.\n\nThe things I’ve been able to do are incredible. This last month I’ve read 9 books and am currently finishing my 10th. This comes from a guy who on a blue moon would maybe, MAYBE, finish reading 1 book a year. \n\nThis works. It’s an absolute life hack and practically a steal for the value it gives. Do you want to change your future? Now for the price of two Happy Meals. Happy focusing! (Smiley)", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id217724691"}, "name":{"label":"hcvera"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-08T08:58:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"2"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"1906461754"}, "title":{"label":"Outrageous expensive with many other free options out there"}, "content":{"label":"There are many different apps and hacks for working defined periods of time with classical, concentration or creative music. This app is free for only 14 days then you have to pay up. App works well but a rip-off. Save yourself money and Google articles and other free apps.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id137744978"}, "name":{"label":"LeisureSuitLarry9"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-11-01T01:40:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"4"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"1889369524"}, "title":{"label":"It pays for itself many times over every day."}, "content":{"label":"I measured my productivity with focus@will vs playing other music in background. F@W is hands down winner. It is better than pomadoro apps because the music is geared toward work and constantly changing so it does not become familiar. Better than just background music because no fiddling around looking for what I want to hear. I don’t really “hear” F@W per se, it just plays and masks distractions. \n\nWhy four stars vs five?  I play it on iPad linked via Bluetooth to a nice stereo system.  There is no volume control on the iPad user interface so a conversation with a client causes me to go fumbling around for volume button on edge of iPad.  Also - it would be extremely useful to know how many complete sessions I have accomplished during the day. For example, a number displayed on the UI saying 9 would tell me I got in 9 sessions so far today.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id31511240"}, "name":{"label":"Mcint001"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-10-20T18:58:54-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"1863231471"}, "title":{"label":"4 days trying to access my account and it still doesn’t work!"}, "content":{"label":"I have been with Amazon support, canceled my subscription through them because it wasn’t working. I created another subscription and it still will not let me log in. There is absolutely no place for direct support that I could find, only option was to leave a message and hope they would get back to me. \n\nI’ll wait a little longer before giving up on this because it seems like a great idea with poor execution.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
