{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id17058450"}, "name":{"label":"Fittsbit"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-08-08T10:26:40-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.6"}, "id":{"label":"1718893207"}, "title":{"label":"Life Time Subscriber"}, "content":{"label":"I preach the Focus@Will gospel to any creative I know. Being able to turn off the outside noise and focus on a particular writing or designing project is SIGNIFICANTLY easier with my Focus@Will app. \n\nI love it so much that when they offered a way to purchase a lifetime subscription last year, I bought immediately. \n\nDo your focus a favor. Check out this app. \n\nStill not sure? Head to their website and read about the science behind their work. \n\nFYI. My two favorite channels are Alpha Chill and Coffee House.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
