{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id242390283"}, "name":{"label":"Johnnievp"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-07T10:32:53-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"1636653895"}, "title":{"label":"Offers 50% discount? But wait..."}, "content":{"label":"Don't know why anyone would pay for a full price subscription to this site, as it seems after a short period of inactivity after the free subscription period, one is offered a 50% off subscription discount to everything but the rather inflated month to month price. But wait, there's a catch - you might find that the discount doesn't apply correctly when you go to checkout, and when you email support about it, no reply, as their email support certainly seems to have gone away. Not sure I'd want to pay for subscription for a service like this if it's apparently no longer active (or at least reasonably timely) in providing support with payment/subscription issues. Would not recommend.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id37200705"}, "name":{"label":"Coastinganon"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-06-04T07:20:14-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"1633473658"}, "title":{"label":"Wonderful resource for the ADHD mind"}, "content":{"label":"I have been a consumer of Focus@Will since the early days.  I was skeptical back then because I was never able to listen to music while studying or trying to get something done, so I couldn't imagine this working.  How wrong I was.  Once I found my ideal music style - inexplicably for this classically trained musician it is techno music - the driving beat became part of my background and absolutely engaged the part of my mind that never seemed to stop thinking about other things.  The price for this is costly, but the benefit is priceless.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id23858750"}, "name":{"label":"Angry N"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-30T05:35:21-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"1628611814"}, "title":{"label":"Love this app!"}, "content":{"label":"Focus@will has helped increase my productivity by at least 25%. I love the wide range of musical genres, along with the built in timer. I can't work without this!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id34942674"}, "name":{"label":"JOL Holodeck"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-23T09:33:30-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"1622164913"}, "title":{"label":"It works."}, "content":{"label":"I have been a subscriber to this service for over 2 years. I simply couldn't say that if it didn't work. Any time I need to lose myself in my work, Focus@Will comes on, and I pull out hours later, having accomplished more than I possibly could have otherwise. Genius.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
