{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id35767747"}, "name":{"label":"Nicothegolden"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-05-06T04:57:18-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"1"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"1606667487"}, "title":{"label":"Really Frustrating App"}, "content":{"label":"I found out about this on a study skills blog and was excited to try it. Unfortunately had the same experience as many others. I wanted to do the free trial before committing, so I made an account, confirmed email, provided my CC, etc. The app requires me to login every time I open it. Once I am in and try to play music it redirects me back to the login page. After the second login, the screen goes blank with a logo on the top, and I have to force quit the app. I followed the instructions on their troubleshooting page, deleted and reinstalled the app, rebooted my phone - no change. So now I've wasted about 80 minutes on the back and forth, given some random company my CC info for a useless app and still have yet to hear one song. Needs more work.", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}, 
