{"author":{"uri":{"label":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/reviews/id166723308"}, "name":{"label":"sunflower-24-7"}, "label":""}, "updated":{"label":"2017-02-25T15:20:50-07:00"}, "im:rating":{"label":"5"}, "im:version":{"label":"1.3.4"}, "id":{"label":"1552572636"}, "title":{"label":"Love this app!"}, "content":{"label":"I have used this app every day since adding it to my device.  Is now my \"go to\" music source while working.  Upgraded to lifetime membership because I use it so heavily.\n\nMy favorite features of the app include:\n-- Variety of listening genres from which to choose\n-- Have not noticed nor been distracted by \"repeat\" tracks\n-- Able to adjust the tempo (referred to as \"Music Energy Level\") of each genre while listening; Have found this can significantly impact my ability to concentrate on the task at hand and my tempo preferences can vary by genre, time of day, task, etc.\n-- Overall consistency of the listening experience; Can choose a genre and tempo and be certain the listening experience will play continuously for hours\n\nRight now my favorite genres are acoustical, ambient, and cafe focus beta which simulates the background noise of working in a cafe setting--handy when wish for a break from music.\n\nThank you Focus@Will!!", "attributes":{"type":"text"}}, "link":{"attributes":{"rel":"related", "href":"https://itunes.apple.com/us/review?id=638810714&type=Purple%20Software"}}, "im:voteSum":{"label":"0"}, "im:contentType":{"attributes":{"term":"Application", "label":"Application"}}, "im:voteCount":{"label":"0"}}], "updated":{"label":"2026-09-01T16:17:51-07:00"}, "rights":{"label":"Copyright 2008 Apple Inc."}, "title":{"label":"iTunes Store: Customer Reviews"}, "icon":{"label":"http://itunes.apple.com/favicon.ico"}, "link":[
